
config INPUT_GLASSHUB_NOTLE
	tristate "Google Glass XE-C glasshub MCU"
	depends on I2C && OF
	help
	  Runtime handshake driver for the Google Glass XE-C ("notle") glasshub
	  MCU on I2C4 0x35: it checks the part id, reads the firmware version,
	  boots the MCU application and reports on-head (don/doff) and wink as
	  input events. The firmware-reflash path is deliberately not
	  implemented (it is unrecoverable). Added out of mainline by
	  OpenMyGlass (glass-mainline); see docs/mainline-bringup.md.
